# Turning the knobs while notes ring: a held bell chord whose structure sweeps string -> glass and back while P2
# opens from damped to long ring and into the bow, with bends on top. Every partial glides; no clicks.
tempo 100
steps 32
tail 3.0
track chord
preset 204 120 0 0 255 90 0 0 128 0 128 150 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C3 32 110
note 0 G3 32 110
note 0 E4 32 110
sweep p1 204 0 1 8
sweep p1 0 255 8 20
sweep p1 255 128 20 30
sweep p2 120 250 4 24
bend 12 200
bend 16 -200
bend 20 0
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 60
expect peak_below -3
